            "\\noindent \\textbf{Non-X$\\rightarrow$X (X=\\{Classification, QA, NLI, Paraphase\\})}: Lastly, we experiment with four settings where meta-training tasks do not overlap with target tasks in task format and required capabilities. These settings require the most challenging generalization capacities.\n",
